id: icon-button
name: Icon button (standard, filled, tonal, outlined, toggle)
category: actions
summary: A 48dp touch target around a 40dp icon container. Always named with aria-label.
requires: foundation
@@spec
- Visible container 40dp, touch target 48dp (the button itself is 48dp, the container is a pseudo-element).
- Icon 24dp. Standard style has no container until hover.
- Toggle: aria-pressed true swaps to the filled container and the filled icon variation.
- State layers 8% hover, 10% focus and pressed.
@@a11y
- Every icon button needs aria-label (or aria-labelledby). An icon or emoji is not a name.
- The glyph span is aria-hidden="true".
- Toggle buttons carry aria-pressed, and the label stays stable ("Bookmark"), not "Bookmarked".
@@html
<button class="md-icon-btn" type="button" aria-label="Open menu">
  <span class="md-icon" aria-hidden="true">menu</span>
</button>

<button class="md-icon-btn md-icon-btn--tonal" type="button" aria-label="Search">
  <span class="md-icon" aria-hidden="true">search</span>
</button>

<!-- toggle -->
<button class="md-icon-btn md-icon-btn--toggle" type="button" aria-label="Bookmark" aria-pressed="false">
  <span class="md-icon" aria-hidden="true">bookmark</span>
</button>
@@css
.md-icon-btn {
  --_bg: transparent;
  --_c: var(--md-on-surface-variant);
  position: relative;
  display: inline-grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 3rem;
  height: 3rem;
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--_c);
  cursor: pointer;
  user-select: none;
}

.md-icon-btn::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0.25rem;
  border-radius: var(--shape-full);
  background-color: var(--_bg);
  transition:
    background-color var(--md-spring-fast-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-effects),
    border-radius var(--md-spring-fast-spatial-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-spatial);
}

.md-icon-btn .md-icon { position: relative; }

.md-icon-btn--filled   { --_bg: var(--md-primary);             --_c: var(--md-on-primary); }
.md-icon-btn--tonal    { --_bg: var(--md-secondary-container); --_c: var(--md-on-secondary-container); }
.md-icon-btn--outlined::before { border: 0.0625rem solid var(--md-outline); }

.md-icon-btn:hover::before          { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--_c) 8%, var(--_bg)); }
.md-icon-btn:focus-visible::before  { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--_c) 10%, var(--_bg)); }
.md-icon-btn:active::before {
  background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--_c) 10%, var(--_bg));
  border-radius: var(--shape-md);
}

.md-icon-btn--toggle[aria-pressed="true"] {
  --_bg: var(--md-primary);
  --_c: var(--md-on-primary);
}
.md-icon-btn--toggle[aria-pressed="true"]::before { border-radius: var(--shape-md); }
.md-icon-btn--toggle[aria-pressed="true"] .md-icon { font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1, "wght" 400, "GRAD" 0, "opsz" 24; }

.md-icon-btn:disabled {
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--md-on-surface) 38%, transparent);
  cursor: not-allowed;
  pointer-events: none;
}
